It is based on ESP-Miner commit 4fd18cef ("Configurable self test warmup temp
(#1764)"). Heatbit Inc. modified it from 2025 to 2026:

- added Bitair support: board configuration, PWM power and fan input from the
  display, indication LED, TPM-300A and AHT20 sensors (main/, components/bitair_hw);
- added Wi-Fi station management and BLE Wi-Fi provisioning
  (components/wifi_manager, components/ble_provisioning);
- added the Heatbit cloud client: telemetry, remote control, pool settings,
  OTA updates, device identity and client certificates (components/heatbit,
  components/device_state, components/device_identity, components/backend_auth,
  components/ota_update);
- added a thermal governor and changed power management, fault handling and the
  frequency ramp (main/tasks, main/thermal, components/asic);
- removed the AxeOS web UI, HTTP API, display, BAP and statistics.

The git history of this repository records every change after the base commit.

